{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/u030tD7-iLQmtEMQ3eOTtw","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:55:20.173764+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/u030tD7-iLQmtEMQ3eOTtw","html":"<div><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>关于接收2027年</span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span><span>研究生</span></span><span><span>推免生预报名的</span></span><span><span>通知</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>1</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>申请对象</span></b></p></section></section></section><section><p><span>具有或预计获得推荐免试资格的2027届普通全日制本科毕</span><span><span>业生（含本校及外校），且符合以下基本条件：</span></span></p><p><span>1.拥护中国共产党的领导，具有正确的政治方向，热爱祖国</span><span><span>愿意为社会主义现代化建设服务，遵纪守法，品行端正；</span></span></p><p><span>2.勤奋学习，刻苦钻研，成绩优秀，学术研究兴趣浓厚，有</span><span><span>较强的创新意识、创新能力和专业能力倾向；</span></span></p><p><span>3.诚实守信，学风端正，无任何考试作弊、剽窃他人学术成</span><span><span>果以及其他违法违纪受处分记录；</span></span></p><p><span><span>4.身心健康，符合国家规定的体检标准。</span></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>2</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>申请材料</span></b></p></section></section></section><section><p><span>1、预报名申请表1份。</span></p><p><span>2、本科阶段成绩单1份。</span></p><p><span>3、英语水平证明材料（如CET-4、CET-6、IELTS、TOEFL等</span><span><span>证书扫描件）。</span></span></p><p><span>4、申请人还可提交获奖证书、体现自身学术水平的代表性</span><span><span>学术论文、出版物或原创性工作效果等材料复印件。</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>请将上述申请材料制成PDF格式后，压缩成一个zip格式文件</span><span><span>并注明</span><span><span>“姓名-本科学校-申请专业-手机号码”</span></span><span>后发至指定邮箱。</span></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>3</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>申请方法</span></b></p></section></section></section><section><p><span>（一）网上报名</span></p><p><span>申请人按要求填写预报名申请表。</span></p><p><span>（二）申请材料提交</span></p><p><span>申请人请于</span><span><span>2026年9月15日</span></span><span>前将上述要求的电子材料提交到专用邮箱：</span><span><span>739196373@qq.com</span></span></p><p><span>（三）</span><span><span>资格初审</span></span></p><p><span>学院研究生招生领导小组对申请进行初审，确认是否接收申请，并请申请者提供准确联系信息，届时学院将通知初审合格的申请者参加复试。</span></p><p><span>（四）复试考核</span></p><p><span>复试采取综合面试的方式进行。</span></p><p><span>（五）推免生录取</span></p><p><span>所有通过我校推免生复试考核，获得我校推免候选人资格的推免生均须在规定时间内登录“全国推荐免试攻读研究生（免初试、转段）信息公开管理服务系统”（以下简称推免服务系统）报考我校，接收并确认学院的“复试通知”与“待录取通知”。</span></p><p><span><span>推免服务系统开放时间请关注中国研究生招生信息网相关公告。规定时间内未在推免服务系统确认接受我校发放的“复试通知”与“待录取通知”的学生，将无法获得我校接收推免生录取资格。</span></span><span><br/></span></p><p><span>（六）接受的专业为社会学学硕、社会工作专硕、新闻传播专硕、国际中文教育专硕。</span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>4</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>奖学金体系</span></b></p></section></section></section><section><p><span>全日制硕士研究生奖助体系包括学业奖学金、国家助学金、国家奖学金、江西省政府奖学金、优秀奖学金、单项奖学金、“三助”岗位津贴等多项奖助学金。</span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>5</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>注意事项</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><p><span>1、报名阶段，接受时间从即日起至9月20</span><span><span>日止，请有意者尽早报名。</span></span></p><p><span>2、请申请者务必提供自身准确有效的联系方式、联系邮箱，以免错失机会。</span></p><p><span>3、申请人必须保证提交的全部申请材料的真实性和准确性。我院将对拟录取的推荐免试研究生张榜公示，如果申请人提交的信息不真实或不准确，我校将取消其录取资格或取消其学籍。</span></p><p><span>4、我院2024年获批社会学一级博士点，符合条件的推免生可以优先推荐硕博连读。</span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><p><span><span>编辑|</span><span>谌韵安</span></span><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>责编|</span><span>刘欣媛 谌韵安</span></span></p><p><span><span>文字来源|</span><span>社会与人文学院</span></span></p><p><span><span>审核|</span><span>张文婷 殷微微</span></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/dQmYmNDKb7yCPZy62Yib7VE58RuHNfLUBPAU6QonloyE4ibFIWjUUMe77DT1xV8cia1dfkKKF1FxlDPBbZA4AFkNQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></span></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/VvKzsqugG87VDtHqjDOGskiaHvDZSeWsdugyDLibXLlgREBWn1vk4nJJM9XQDFVp3p8JVA265InAibibgjNsNhXX8Q/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></span></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/dQmYmNDKb7yCPZy62Yib7VE58RuHNfLUB79piaLaxk2eKBgCUib28FTZxBkEib8zjWl6b6TEKhVT8yaAb7z1gAEX6g/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>长按二维码</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>关注江西财经大学社会与人文学院公众号</span></strong></p><p><span>                              </span></p><p><strong><span><br/></span></strong></p><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/dQmYmNDKb7yCPZy62Yib7VE58RuHNfLUBsQ06jIReHyxL7jOqb1A0iay8PZOM08Uf9TypBibroFXnbcMfQiaDTA49A/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><p><span>想法丨发现丨习惯丨人文</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>让阅读成为习惯，让灵魂拥有温度</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><span><br/></span></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"708be8b427285ad5b909cebb2a010486730fb54fa5228b7bef2a7f87a523ea46","textLength":1182,"sourceSha256":"fd0bf0c95fe19f0876ee7cb3dad938d3b799e67d0f8bee94dc59b83a299ed758","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-62d814150956271a1f18","title":"2026年江西财经大学社会与人文学院关于接收2027年研究生推免生预报名的通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:55:20.173764+00:00"}
